  "description_html": "<p data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"658\"><strong data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"295\">The Aero Innovation Challenge</strong> is an exciting platform for aspiring innovators, technologists, and aerospace enthusiasts to showcase their creativity and problem-solving skills. This challenge aims to address real-world problems in the aerospace sector by encouraging participants to design, develop, and present innovative solutions inspired by nature that could revolutionize flight systems.</p>\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"1068\">Participants will get the opportunity to explore cutting-edge concepts inspired by biological systems such as bird flight dynamics, insect wing mechanisms, energy-efficient gliding, swarm intelligence, and other natural aerodynamic principles. With a strong focus on creativity, feasibility, and impact, the challenge fosters interdisciplinary collaboration, technical expertise, and out-of-the-box thinking.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1112\"><strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1080\">Theme:</strong> Bio-Mimicry in Flight Systems</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iin799\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1134\">Team Description</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1275\">\n<li data-section-id=\"2nvhs6\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1187\">\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1187\">A team of <strong data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1173\">maximum 3 participants</strong> is allowed.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jh3azn\" data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1275\">\n<p data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1275\">Participants can be <strong data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1274\">interdisciplinary, across years, and from different colleges</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ncgea\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1299\">Competition Rounds</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1343\">The competition consists of <strong data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1342\">two rounds</strong>:</p>\n<ol data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1410\">\n<li data-section-id=\"15ka7bk\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1378\">\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1378\"><strong data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1376\">Abstract Submission Round</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"9ir4pt\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1410\">\n<p data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1410\"><strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1410\">Final Presentation Round</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
